                               {
                                   "title":  "Wikipedia: Inside Mari",
                                   "snippet":  "[Wikipedia Synopsis] Inside Mari (Japanese: ぼくは麻理のなか, Hepburn: Boku wa Mari no Naka) is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Shūzō Oshimi. It was serialized in Futabasha\u0027s  Manga Action from March 2012 to September 2016, and published in nine volumes. An eight-episode television drama adaptation from Fuji TV was released in March 2017.",
                                   "link":  "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inside%20Mari"
                               }
